    "text": "A solution of sodium sulphate contains <math><mn>92</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>g</mi></math> of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Na</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></math> ions per kilogram of water. The molality of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Na</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></math> ions in that solution in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>mol</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mi>kg</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> is:"
